==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Yellow Lizalfos Tails are [[Monster Part]]s that are dropped by [[Electric Lizalfos]], which can be found in the [[Gerudo Desert]] and [[Hyrule Ridge]], when killed. Though their smell makes them unable to be cooked, Yellow Lizalfos Tails can be mixed with critters in a [[Cooking Pot]] to make [[Elixir]]s.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> They can also be exchanged with [[Kilton]] at the [[Fang and Bone]] for [[Mon]] or used at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]] to make [[Yellow Dye]].

The [[Rubber Armor (Set)|Rubber Armor]] set requires Yellow Lizalfos Tails for its third and fourth upgrades at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]].
